OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused to face trial over
OL,4,Aman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering another man
OL,7,Fwho died in hospital after being
OL,8,Fassaulted in the street will stand
OL,9,Ftrial next year.
OL,11,FMark Shaw, 43, was critically injured
OL,12,Fduring an attack in Ramshead Crescent,
OL,13,Fin the Seacroft area of Leeds, on the
OL,14,Fevening of 9 July and died in hospital
OL,15,Ffour days later.
OL,17,FOn Thursday, Hayden Clarke, 27,
OL,18,Fappeared at Leeds Crown Court where he
OL,19,Fpleaded guilty to manslaughter but not
OL,20,Fguilty to murder.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
