OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused to face trial over
OL,4,Aman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the hearing Judge Simon Phillips
OL,7,FKC fixed a trial date for 12 January
OL,8,Fbefore remanding Clarke, of Halton Moor
OL,9,FRoad, in Leeds, into custody ahead of
OL,10,Fhis next appearance.
